<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Notification small icon.

    Android renders the small icon as a silhouette: every non transparent pixel is painted with the
    system's own color, so this asset is deliberately a flat, single path glyph rather than the
    colored launcher icon. A bell with a griffin beak notch reads as "Griff reminder" even at 24dp,
    and the 8dp of padding around it keeps the glyph inside the circle Android masks it into.
-->
